          "path": "_m/t/e/k/2/sinhagad-wp/snake-in-a-littered-environmen.jpg",
          "filename": "Snake in a littered environment.jpg",
          "caption": "I and my friends were wandering on Sinhagad Fort in Pune, the fort is flocked by people round the year. Consequently the surrounding jungle is littered with non biodegradable waste. As i was going around such a patch i noticed this snake wandering in the littered plastics and wrappers. The photo is a depiction of how severely we have encroached and damaged mother nature. There were shards of glass bottles lying around the area. Not only the snake any animal would get affected in such an area.",
